  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "Kyte options market",
  "description": "Reviews the hosted Kyte MCP server for the non-custodial options market on Robinhood Chain. Reads return public on-chain market data: tokens, offers, prices, charts, positions, staking, fee proof and Pons launchpad graduations. Prepare tools only return a kyte.sh link for the user to review and sign in their own wallet; the server holds no keys and sends no transactions. Prepares and unknown tools need review. Off until you turn it on.",
